  "description": "External magnetic field models for .NET: A C# port of the external magnetic field models (T89, T96, etc.) for magnetospheric and solar-terrestrial studies.\n\n      This C# implementation is a derivative work of the original FORTRAN code by Nikolai Tsyganenko, and is distributed under the same GNU GPL v3 license.",
